<view class="tab-page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">为什么需要提额？</view>
    <view class="muted">平台默认每人可创建 {{quota.default_limit}} 个组织，避免滥建。若你是老师/家委需管理多个班级或小区，请说明场景并上传证明。</view>
    <view class="muted" style="margin-top: 8rpx;">当前额度 {{quota.limit}}，已用 {{quota.used}}。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">希望提高到（个）</view>
      <input type="number" placeholder="例如 5" value="{{requestedLimit}}" bindinput="onLimit" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">原因说明（必填，至少 20 字）</view>
      <textarea
        placeholder="例如：本人为阳光小学三年级班主任，需分别为 1 班、2 班、兴趣社创建组织，方便班级内以物换物管理。"
        value="{{reason}}"
        bindinput="onReason"
        maxlength="1000"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">证明材料（必填，如教师资格证）</view>
      <view class="proof-row">
        <view class="proof" wx:for="{{proofs}}" wx:key="*this">
          <image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" />
          <view class="proof-del" data-i="{{index}}" bindtap="delProof">×</view>
        </view>
        <view class="proof add" bindtap="addProof" wx:if="{{proofs.length < 5}}">+</view>
      </view>
      <view class="muted">最多 5 张，请拍摄证件清晰面，仅用于平台审核。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="actions">
    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="submit">提交提额申请</button>
  </view>
</view>
